       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-COAXIAL-MUX.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-COAXIAL-MUX-PROOFS.
           05  WS-4BOX-TDM-MUX-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIRECT-SWIGLU-STREAM-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-COPY-MEMORY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-IMPEDANCE-BALANCE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-COAXIAL-MUX-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-COAXIAL-MUX-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-COAXIAL-MUX-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-COAXIAL-MUX-CODE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MUX-AND-STREAM.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MEMORY-AND-IMPEDANCE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-COAXIAL-MUX-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MUX-AND-STREAM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-4BOX-TDM-MUX-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIRECT-SWIGLU-STREAM-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MEMORY-AND-IMPEDANCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-COPY-MEMORY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-IMPEDANCE-BALANCE-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-COAXIAL-MUX-PROOFS.
           IF WS-4BOX-TDM-MUX-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DIRECT-SWIGLU-STREAM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-COPY-MEMORY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-IMPEDANCE-BALANCE-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-COAXIAL-MUX-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-COAXIAL-MUX-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-COAXIAL-MUX-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-COAXIAL-MUX-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-COAXIAL-MUX-CODE.
